     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Genitive and negation",
     "texto": [
      "With **nie mam** («I don't have») and with some negated transitive verbs, the object usually takes the genitive: **mam czas → nie mam czasu**.",
      "Don't generalise to all verbs: the case depends on the verb and its meaning. The Polish genitive has no single fixed English translation."
     ],
